{"id":"torrey:holy-spirit-the-teacher-the","source":"torrey","name":"Holy Spirit, The Teacher, The","slug":"holy-spirit-the-teacher-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Promised — Pr 1:23.","refs":[["Prov",1,23,1,23]]},{"text":"As the Spirit of wisdom — Isa 11:2; 40:13,14.","refs":[["Isa",11,2,11,2],["Isa",40,13,40,13],["Isa",40,14,40,14]]},{"text":"In answer to prayer. — Eph 1:16,17.","refs":[["Eph",1,16,1,16],["Eph",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"To saints. — Ne 9:20; 1Co 2:12,13.","refs":[["Neh",9,20,9,20],["1Cor",2,12,2,12],["1Cor",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Necessity for — 1Co 2:9,10.","refs":[["1Cor",2,9,2,9],["1Cor",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Reveals the things of God. — 1Co 2:10,13.","refs":[["1Cor",2,10,2,10],["1Cor",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Reveals the things of Christ. — Joh 16:14.","refs":[["John",16,14,16,14]]},{"text":"Reveals the future. — Lu 2:26; Ac 21:11.","refs":[["Luke",2,26,2,26],["Acts",21,11,21,11]]},{"text":"Brings the words of Christ to remembrance. — Joh 14:26.","refs":[["John",14,26,14,26]]},{"text":"Directs in the way of godliness. — Isa 30:21; Eze 36:27.","refs":[["Isa",30,21,30,21],["Ezek",36,27,36,27]]},{"text":"Teaches saints to answer persecutors. — Mr 13:11; Lu 12:12.","refs":[["Mark",13,11,13,11],["Luke",12,12,12,12]]},{"text":"Enables ministers to teach. — 1Co 12:8.","refs":[["1Cor",12,8,12,8]]},{"text":"Guides into all truth. — Joh 14:26; 16:13.","refs":[["John",14,26,14,26],["John",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Directs the decisions of the Church. — Ac 15:28.","refs":[["Acts",15,28,15,28]]},{"text":"Attend to the instruction of — Re 2:7,11,29.","refs":[["Rev",2,7,2,7],["Rev",2,11,2,11],["Rev",2,29,2,29]]},{"text":"The natural man will not receive the things of — 1Co 2:14.","refs":[["1Cor",2,14,2,14]]}],"refCount":29}
